00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:55.948
Ah, mohon maaf sebesar-besarnya.

00:06:56.582 --> 00:06:58.084
Aduh, mohon maaf. Beneran ada suratnya?

00:06:58.518 --> 00:06:58.918
