Ah, oke.

00:08:29.175 --> 00:08:29.909
Kalau begitu, aku berangkat dulu, ya.

00:08:30.176 --> 00:08:30.676
Ya, tolong ya.

00:08:30.877 --> 00:08:31.878
Maaf merepotkanmu.

00:08:35.581 --> 00:08:36.582
I...

